{
  "_comment": [
    "Codex hook wiring for monday-apps. Mirrors .claude/settings.json one-for-one:",
    "the same scripts under .claude/hooks/ do the enforcing, reached through",
    ".codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py which translates Codex's payload shape into the",
    "one those scripts expect. Do not fork the hook logic here — change it in",
    ".claude/hooks/ and both agents pick it up.",
    "",
    "Requires `[features] codex_hooks = true` in ~/.codex/config.toml, and the",
    "project .codex/ layer must be trusted. See .codex/README.md.",
    "",
    "Matchers are deliberately broad: Codex has renamed its shell tool across",
    "versions, and the adapter is the real filter (it drops any tool it does not",
    "map). An over-broad matcher costs one no-op process; a too-narrow one costs",
    "the guarantee."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec bash \"$R/.codex/hooks/session-brief.sh\"'",
            "statusMessage": "Loading monday-apps house rules",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "shell|Bash|bash|local_shell|exec_command|run_command|shell_command|container.exec",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec python3 \"$R/.codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py\" .claude/hooks/deploy-guard.sh'",
            "statusMessage": "deploy-guard: checking for a local deploy",
            "timeout": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec python3 \"$R/.codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py\" .claude/skills/test-guard/hooks/testfile-lock.sh'",
            "statusMessage": "test-guard: checking the test-file lock",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "apply_patch|Edit|Write|MultiEdit|edit_file|str_replace_editor",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec python3 \"$R/.codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py\" .claude/skills/test-guard/hooks/testfile-lock.sh'",
            "statusMessage": "test-guard: checking the test-file lock",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "shell|Bash|bash|local_shell|exec_command|run_command|shell_command|container.exec",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec python3 \"$R/.codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py\" .claude/hooks/release-debt-nudge.sh'",
            "statusMessage": "checking release debt",
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "apply_patch|Edit|Write|MultiEdit|edit_file|str_replace_editor",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec python3 \"$R/.codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py\" .claude/hooks/graphql-write-reminder.sh'",
            "statusMessage": "monday-api: checking GraphQL writes",
            "timeout": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec python3 \"$R/.codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py\" .claude/hooks/error-guard-check.sh'",
            "statusMessage": "error-guard: checking error handling",
            "timeout": 25
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec python3 \"$R/.codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py\" .claude/skills/test-guard/hooks/route-nudge.sh'",
            "statusMessage": "test-guard: routing check",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'R=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd); exec python3 \"$R/.codex/hooks/codex-adapter.py\" .claude/skills/test-guard/hooks/stop-gate.sh'",
            "statusMessage": "test-guard: session stop gate",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
